  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">형<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>졘<ruby style=\"position: relative\">걀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gD14iiXq7Xw?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">火車<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">훼ˆ챠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">漸漸<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">쟘쟘ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">起行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">키ˆ걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    huê-chiâ jiam-jiām lêh-khî-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">再會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">재`훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">故鄉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거`형ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">親情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">친ˉ쟐ˊ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jài-huē goà’e kòr-hiông kâh-chīn-jiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">親愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">친ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">爸母<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">베뿌`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">再會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">재`훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’밯\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    chīn-ai’e pe-bù jài-huē’pah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">鬥陣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄃᅷ`딘ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">朋友<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">볭유`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">告辭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">고`시ˊ</rt></ruby>’랗\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tàu-tīn’e pieng-yù kò-sí’lah\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來去<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">래킈`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">台北<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">대박</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">拍拚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà bêh-lai-khì-tai-pak phâh-pia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聽人講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">턀ˉ랑겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥物<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">好<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">캉<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">햐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thiā̰-lang-kông-siâ̰-mîh hô-khâng’e lông-ti-hiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">朋友<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">볭유`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">笑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쵸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">애`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">做<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">죄`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">眠夢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">삔빵ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">慐囝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">껑걀`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pieng-yù chiò-goà si-ài-joè-bin-bāng’e gong-kià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">管<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">如何<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뚜호ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">路<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">家己<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    m-koân-ru-hó lōr si-kā-kī kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    옿! <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">再會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">재`훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’밯!\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    oh! jài-huē’pah!\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    옿! <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥物<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렁<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">驚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">걀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    oh! siâ̰-mîh lông-m-kiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    옿! <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">再會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">재`훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’밯!\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    oh! jài-huē’pah!\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    옿! <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">向前行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">형`졘걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    oh! hiòng-jien-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">車站<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">챠ˉ잠ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一站<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇잠-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一站<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇잠ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">過<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">궤</rt></ruby>’릐랗\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    chiā-jām jit-jam-jit-jām kue’li-lah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風景<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헝ˉ곙`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一幕<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇뻐-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一幕<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇뻐ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">親像<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">電影<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뎬얄`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hōng-kièng jit-bor-jit-bōr chīn-chiṵ-tien-yà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    가<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">家己<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">當做<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">덩ˉ죄`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">男主角<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">람주ˆ각</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">搬<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">봘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ka̰-kā-kī tōng-joè-si-lam-jû-kak lai-poâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雲遊四海<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.5em\">훈유수`해`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">可比<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">코ˆ비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">小飛俠<rt style=\"font-size: 42%;position: absolute;top: -1.5em;left: -0.3em\">ㄒㄧㄠㄈㄟㄒㄧㄚˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hun-yu-sù-hài khô-pî-si-<i>xiǎo fēi xiá</i>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">管<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幼稚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">유`디ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">抑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">얗</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">樂觀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">럭관ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    m-koân-si-yù-tī yah-si-lork-koân\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">後果<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">효고`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">按怎<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">안ˆ좔`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">家己<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby> 됴<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">擔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">달ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hio-kò na-ân-joà̰ kā-kī tio-lai-tâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">原諒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꽌령-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">不孝<rt sty